Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.34,0:09:27.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢您的等候  接下来将为您服务
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.35,0:09:29.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You were the next caller five hours ago. 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.35,0:09:29.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}五个小时前就说要为您服务了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.62,0:09:31.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You must be going crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.62,0:09:31.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你一定快疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.48,0:09:33.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nah. I kept myself busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.48,0:09:33.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有哦  我也没闲着
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.92,0:09:45.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, yeah, I put your stuff in her room and her stuff in your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.92,0:09:45.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对了  我把你们房里的东西对调了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.42,0:09:53.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.42,0:09:53.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你还好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.57,0:09:55.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fabulous.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.57,0:09:55.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好极了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.91,0:09:59.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Listen, drama critics, they're nothing but, 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.91,0:09:59.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着  那些剧评家
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.20,0:10:01.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but people who couldn't make it as actors.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.20,0:10:01.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只是当不成演员的人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.01,0:10:03.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You know what you should do? - Become a drama critic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.01,0:10:03.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你知道你该怎么做吗  -去当剧评家
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.28,0:10:10.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.28,0:10:10.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我受伤了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.74,0:10:14.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A plague...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.74,0:10:14.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}祝你们两家
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.47,0:10:17.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...on both your houses!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.47,0:10:17.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}遭蝗虫瘟疫之灾
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.13,0:10:22.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}By the way, he dumped me tonight after he read my review.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.13,0:10:22.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对了  他看完剧评之后甩了我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.56,0:10:25.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Oh, classy. - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.56,0:10:25.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-真过份  -是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.84,0:10:29.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I sure know how to pick them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.84,0:10:29.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还真有眼光
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.58,0:10:33.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know I gave up a part on a soap for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.58,0:10:33.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我为了这出戏放弃一出连续剧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.75,0:10:37.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow! Yeah I ah, I gave up a job too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.75,0:10:37.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也放弃了一份工作
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.97,0:10:41.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Really? What? - Declawing cats.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.97,0:10:41.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-是吗  什么工作  -替猫咪剪指甲
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.09,0:10:45.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, tell you what, let me walk you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.09,0:10:45.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样吧  我陪你走回家
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.89,0:10:47.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We'll stop by every newsstand 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.89,0:10:47.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们在每个报摊停下 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.47,0:10:50.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and burn every copy of The Times and The Post.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.47,0:10:50.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}烧掉所有的时报和邮报
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.51,0:10:52.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Why The Post?. - You didn't see The Post?.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.51,0:10:52.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-为什么要烧邮报  -你没看邮报吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.99,0:10:55.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- No. You? - No. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.99,0:10:55.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-没有  你看了吗  -没有  怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.08,0:11:06.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You really think these newspapers are just jealous of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.08,0:11:06.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你真觉得那些剧评家是因为嫉妒我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.33,0:11:09.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Absolutely. You're talented and you're good-looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.33,0:11:09.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}绝对的  你有才华  长得又美
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.95,0:11:12.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're sweet and cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.95,0:11:12.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你人好又可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.67,0:11:14.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know. That's why they trashed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.67,0:11:14.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道  所以他们才攻击我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.60,0:11:24.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Wait. Wait a minute. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.60,0:11:24.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-慢着  等一下  -怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.51,0:11:28.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.51,0:11:28.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我实在搞不懂你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.01,0:11:30.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, first you hate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.01,0:11:30.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你先是讨厌我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.74,0:11:33.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then you sleep with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.74,0:11:33.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后跟我上床
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.79,0:11:37.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then you want nothing to do with me. Now you want me again?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.79,0:11:37.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后你又跟我撇清关系  现在又想要我了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.10,0:11:39.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What? So you never went out with an actress before?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.10,0:11:39.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}干嘛  难道你没跟女演员约过会吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.14,0:11:44.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Kate, do you even like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.14,0:11:44.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}凯特  你喜欢我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.87,0:11:50.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Of course I do. - So how come you blew me off?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.87,0:11:50.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-当然喜欢  -那你为什么拒绝我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.43,0:11:54.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I mean, how come you were with him? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.43,0:11:54.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-为什么要跟他在一起  -我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.70,0:11:56.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.70,0:11:56.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.81,0:11:59.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I always have to pick, like, the smartest guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.81,0:11:59.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我总是要挑  挑那个最聪明的...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.83,0:12:02.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...or the most talented guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.83,0:12:02.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或挑那个最有才华的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.20,0:12:05.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why can't I just pick someone like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.20,0:12:05.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我为什么就不能挑一个你这样的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.80,0:12:10.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.80,0:12:10.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.16,0:12:14.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.16,0:12:14.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你懂我的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.72,0:12:18.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, like, the sweetest guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.72,0:12:18.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是说最体贴的人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.68,0:12:21.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Joey. You're just so....
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.68,0:12:21.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊  你真的好...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.76,0:12:23.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're so...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.76,0:12:23.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.06,0:12:27.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...so....
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.06,0:12:27.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.63,0:12:37.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, okay, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.63,0:12:37.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  真是拿你没办法 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.32,0:12:41.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here we go. Let's get your feet up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.32,0:12:41.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}来  把你的脚抬上来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.37,0:12:50.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good night. Kate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.37,0:12:50.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}晚安  凯特
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.04,0:12:53.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sweet dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.04,0:12:53.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}祝你好梦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.22,0:13:02.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm gonna put this can right here in case you have to hurl.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.22,0:13:02.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我把桶放在这里  免得你想倒苦水
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.13,0:13:16.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Please stay on the line. Your call is very important to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.13,0:13:16.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请不要挂断  我们很重视您的来电
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.42,0:13:19.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Pheebs. You've been up for 24 hours. Go to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.42,0:13:19.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比  你已经24小时没睡了  去睡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.77,0:13:21.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Honey. Th-this isn't healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.77,0:13:21.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}亲爱的  这样有损健康
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.33,0:13:23.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.33,0:13:23.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不  我很好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.09,0:13:26.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you know why? Because of all the riboflavin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.09,0:13:26.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道为什么吗  因为我吃了核黄素
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.07,0:13:34.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Didn't you have that on last night? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.07,0:13:34.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-这不还是昨晚那套衣服吗  -对
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.75,0:13:37.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I stayed at Kate's but nothing happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.75,0:13:37.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在凯特家过夜  但是什么也没做
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.08,0:13:39.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Pheebs, where were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.08,0:13:39.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比  你怎么没来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.81,0:13:41.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm so, so sorry Joey. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.81,0:13:41.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很抱歉  乔伊  
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.63,0:13:43.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am definitely gonna see your play.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.63,0:13:43.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我一定会去看你演的戏
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.70,0:13:46.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I swear, your play is very important to us. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.70,0:13:46.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的戏对我们很重要  
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.20,0:13:47.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you for your patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.20,0:13:47.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你的耐心等候
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.32,0:13:50.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your play is the next play I'm gonna see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.32,0:13:50.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很快就会去看你的戏
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.17,0:13:53.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyway, how did it go with Kate?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.17,0:13:53.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你跟凯特怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.52,0:13:54.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, it was great! 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.52,0:13:54.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}感觉好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.76,0:13:56.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I-I walked her home, 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.76,0:13:56.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我陪她走回家  
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.23,0:13:59.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and it was amazing how much weconnected, y'know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.23,0:13:59.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们之间心有灵犀的感觉这棒
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.72,0:14:01.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then ah, then she passed out,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.72,0:14:01.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后她昏了过去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.58,0:14:02.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but then she woke up. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.58,0:14:02.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}后来她又醒了过来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.90,0:14:05.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And we stayed up all night talking, 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.90,0:14:05.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们聊了一整晚
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.76,0:14:08.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and now we're like totally crazy about each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.76,0:14:08.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在我们彻底为彼此疯狂
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.75,0:14:12.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Joey, you had "the night"! - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.75,0:14:12.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-乔伊  你经历了"关键性的一晚"  -什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.75,0:14:15.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When two people realize their feelings for each other...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.75,0:14:15.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当两个人发现他们坠入爱河时
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.33,0:14:18.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and they talk for hours and learn all about the other person.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.33,0:14:18.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们会聊上很久  了解对方的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.41,0:14:20.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.41,0:14:20.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.60,0:14:23.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Did you learn about her family? - Two brothers. One died!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.60,0:14:23.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你了解她的家人吗  -两个兄弟  一个死了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.77,0:14:24.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.77,0:14:24.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.95,0:14:33.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is from the woman at the bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.95,0:14:33.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是吧台那位女士请的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.74,0:14:41.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sorry. She thought you were somebody else.
