Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.65,0:19:34.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《综合医院》还是要我出演
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.75,0:19:35.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.75,0:19:35.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.17,0:19:38.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...what about us?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.17,0:19:38.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那我们呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.93,0:19:41.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Last night was wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.93,0:19:41.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}昨晚感觉很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.73,0:19:44.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But I can't stay here just for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.73,0:19:44.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我不能为了你留下来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.29,0:19:47.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So stay for the museums.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.29,0:19:47.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那就为了博物馆留下来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.40,0:19:50.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I'm sorry. - Joey, on-stage!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.40,0:19:50.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-对不起  -乔伊上场
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.96,0:19:53.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well can you at least stay to the end of the play?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.96,0:19:53.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}至少等到落幕再走  可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.48,0:19:56.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll go to the airport with you. I want to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.48,0:19:56.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我陪你去机场  我想跟你道别
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.25,0:19:58.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Where are you,Vic?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.25,0:19:58.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}维克  你在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.29,0:20:00.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Flight's in an hour. I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.29,0:20:00.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一小时后的班机  我得走了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.60,0:20:01.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Vic?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.60,0:20:01.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}维克
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.45,0:20:04.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Vic?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.45,0:20:04.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}维克
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.08,0:20:07.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Vic! - In a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.08,0:20:07.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-维克  -等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.50,0:20:12.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So this is it, Victor?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.50,0:20:12.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就这样了吗  维克多
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.84,0:20:16.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. I guess it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.84,0:20:16.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想是的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.87,0:20:23.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.87,0:20:23.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.09,0:20:27.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}... I gotta say goodbye, and I gotta say it quick
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.09,0:20:27.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要说再见了  我会长话短说 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.19,0:20:28.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}because this is killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.19,0:20:28.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为我的心好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.42,0:20:33.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}One thing you gotta know is that I will never forget you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.42,0:20:33.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要你知道  我永远不会忘记你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.21,0:20:36.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But you got things you have to do now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.21,0:20:36.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是你有你该做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.57,0:20:39.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And so do l.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.57,0:20:39.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.01,0:20:42.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And so...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.01,0:20:42.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以......
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.44,0:20:46.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}... I'm gonna get on this spaceship...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.44,0:20:46.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要登上太空船
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.35,0:20:58.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and I'm gonna go to Blaargon-7 in search of alternative fuels.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.35,0:20:58.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}前往布拉刚7号星寻找替代燃料
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.54,0:21:03.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But when I return 200 years from now...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.54,0:21:03.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等我两百年后回来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.37,0:21:05.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you'll be long gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.37,0:21:05.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你早就不在人世了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.91,0:21:08.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}... but I won't have aged at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.91,0:21:08.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而我却一点也不会老
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.79,0:21:15.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So you tell your great, great granddaughter...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.79,0:21:15.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以请告诉你的曾曾孙女
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.76,0:21:17.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to look me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.76,0:21:17.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}叫她找我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.92,0:21:21.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because, Adrianne...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.92,0:21:21.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为  爱德莉安
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.07,0:21:22.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}... baby...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.07,0:21:22.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}亲爱的......
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.34,0:21:26.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}... I'm gonna want to meet her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.34,0:21:26.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想见见她
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.52,0:21:36.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So long, Vic!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.52,0:21:36.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别了  维克
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.51,0:21:46.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Phoebe. It's been two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.51,0:21:46.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比  已经两天了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.59,0:21:48.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.59,0:21:48.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.70,0:21:51.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good thing it's one of those 801 numbers, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.70,0:21:51.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}幸好是801免付费电话
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.63,0:21:56.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Phoebe, 800 is toll free. 801 is Utah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.63,0:21:56.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比  800才是免付费电话  801是犹他州码
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.09,0:22:00.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no, no, oh no-no-no,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.09,0:22:00.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不  不  不可能 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.32,0:22:04.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It has to be 800 because all those big companies have 800 numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.32,0:22:04.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一定是800  大公司都有免付费专线
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.01,0:22:05.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Every....
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.01,0:22:05.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}每个......
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.79,0:22:09.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, every big Utah-based company has one.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.79,0:22:09.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}犹他州大公司都是801开头
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.84,0:22:13.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Phoebe! - Sorry. I'm so sorry. I will pay you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.84,0:22:13.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-菲比  -真的很抱歉  我会付钱的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.12,0:22:17.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And yet she's still not hanging up the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.12,0:22:17.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她还是不挂电话
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.23,0:22:19.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hang up! - Hang up the phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.23,0:22:19.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-挂掉啦  -快挂掉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.18,0:22:20.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fine! Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.18,0:22:20.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.06,0:22:26.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.06,0:22:26.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.04,0:22:32.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I think I broke it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.04,0:22:32.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我好像把它摔坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.39,0:22:35.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But that's all right. Here's the number where you can call.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.39,0:22:35.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没关系  你们可以打这个电话号码
